## Solution 2: Extract Score from Quiz Results (If you can't modify course)

If you **don't have access to modify the Articulate Rise course**, use this extraction method.

**Replace your `finalizeWithScore()` function with the code in `ARTICULATE_RISE_SCORE_EXTRACTION.js`**

This will attempt to:
1. First check SCORM API (in case course has score)
2. Then scan the iframe content for quiz results
3. Look for patterns like "Question 4 of 8" or "You scored 85%"
4. Extract and send the score to your backend

### Limitations of Extraction Method:
- ⚠️ Depends on page structure (if Articulate changes HTML layout, extraction breaks)
- ⚠️ Less reliable than proper SCORM implementation
- ✅ Better than nothing!

