## How to Verify SCORM Score Reporting

### Check 1: Look at imsmanifest.xml

Your manifest shows:
```xml
<metadata>
  <schema>ADL SCORM</schema>
  <schemaversion>1.2</schemaversion>
</metadata>
```

✅ It's SCORM 1.2, so it should support score reporting.

### Check 2: Inspect the SCORM Driver Code

In your SCORM package, look for `scormdriver/lms-interface.js`:

**If you see code like this:**
```javascript
// GOOD - Setting SCORM scores
API.LMSSetValue('cmi.core.score.raw', quizScore);
API.LMSSetValue('cmi.core.score.max', totalPoints);
```

✅ Score reporting is enabled

**If you see:**
```javascript
// BAD - Only tracking completion
API.LMSSetValue('cmi.core.lesson_status', 'completed');
// No score being set!
```

❌ Score reporting is disabled

