## Recommended Database View

Create a view to handle both proper SCORM and extracted scores:

```sql
CREATE VIEW dbo.vw_ScormAttemptResults AS
SELECT 
    citSCORMAttemptID,
    citSCORMSessionID,
    CASE 
        WHEN MaxScore IS NOT NULL AND MaxScore > 0
        THEN CAST((RawScore / MaxScore) * 100 AS DECIMAL(9,2))
        WHEN RawScore IS NOT NULL AND RawScore <= 100
        THEN CAST(RawScore AS DECIMAL(9,2))
        ELSE NULL
    END AS CalculatedPercentage,
    RawScore,
    MaxScore,
    IsCompleted,
    CompletionDate,
    LessonStatus
FROM dbo.citSCORMAttempt
WHERE IsCompleted = 1
GO
```

